# Import gate — no UI work until import passes

The product is **not usable** until file import works end-to-end. Do not work on the following until both gate reports are **PASS**:

- CV templates / template gallery
- Photo upload / crop / per-template photo
- Section order / drag-reorder UX
- Pricing / Stripe / Pro paywall UI
- Visual design polish (spacing, typography, colors)
- Animations / motion / transitions

## No fake pass

Read `NO_FAKE_PASS_IMPORT_POLICY.md`. **Terminal status ≠ product PASS.** Scanned/image files that OCR cannot read must be `IMPORT_NEEDS_PASTE` and **fail** the gate.

## Gate reports (all required)

| Report | Verify |
|--------|--------|
| `LOCAL_OCR_CSP_FIX_REPORT.md` | `npm run local-ocr-csp-fix-report` |
| `IMPORT_REALITY_CHECK_REPORT.md` | `npm run import-reality-check-report` |
| `REAL_WORLD_IMPORT_TRUTH_REPORT.md` | `npm run real-world-import-truth-report` |

If either report is **FAIL** or stale, work only on:

- Extraction / OCR / CSP
- Import pipeline / paste fallback / format support
- Import QA scripts and gate reports

## Allowed while gate is open

- Import bugs, extraction quality, parser fixes tied to import
- Review queue / contact consistency if blocking import review
- QA scripts for the two gate reports above

## Current status

Re-read both report files at session start. Treat `**Status:** PASS` in each as the gate signal. If either is missing or FAIL, refuse UI-scope tasks and fix import first.
